## Map the flat servable tree (repo root) into the FHS offline-doc location.
## The root stays flat so it ALSO serves as the GitHub Pages / dist-encrypted
## tree; only the site payload is shipped (repo-meta -- debian/, README,
## make-helper-overrides.bsh, openpgp-policy.toml, dotfiles -- is excluded).
*.html usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
*.js usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
*.css usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
*.json usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
*.png usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
*.svg usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
*.ico usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
*.webmanifest usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
robots.txt usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
_headers usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
wiki usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
media usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
fontawesome usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
fonts usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
libs usr/share/doc/homepage/whonix-wiki-static/
